closure, which returns importAll's errors. Expected: the walk errors (walk.ErrTooMany,
the rootErr global, OnceValues Unresolved, WalkDir errors), context.Cause/ctx.Err
Unresolved entries, jobs.ErrNoHook, the hook's opaque fmt.Errorf, context.Canceled and
context.DeadlineExceeded from Stop. importFile's errors are logged, not returned, so
source/records/stream origins must NOT appear; no "jobs: step: %w" link either.
